{"id":"H3449","lemma":"יִשִּׁיָּהוּ","transliteration":"yishshiyyah","sayIt":"yish-shiy-yah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Isshiah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Issachar living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.3;\nson of: Izrahiah (H3156);\nbrother of: Michael (H4317K), Obadiah (H5662I) and Joel (H3100L)\n§ Ishiah or Ishijah or Jesiah = \"Jehovah will lend\"\n1) a Korhite, one of David's mighty warriors who joined him at Ziklag\n2) the 5th of 5 sons of Izrahiah and one of the heads of the tribe of Issachar in the time of David\n3) a Levite, the 2nd son of Uzziel and grandson of Kohath\n4) another Levite, son of Rehabiah\n5) a descendant of Harim who had a foreign wife","glosses":["isshiah","isshijah"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Isshiah","kjv":"Ishiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-12","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Isshiah","kjv":"and Jesiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Isshiah","kjv":"and Jesiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Isshiah","kjv":"was Isshiah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Isshiah","kjv":"was Isshiah"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"Isshijah","kjv":"Ishijah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:3","note":"The son of Uzzi: Izrahiah. The sons of Izrahiah: Michael, Obadiah, Joel, and Isshiah, five; all of them chief men.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 10:31","note":"Of the sons of Harim: Eliezer, Isshijah, Malchijah, Shemaiah, Shimeon,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3470","lemma":"יְשַׁעְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"yeshayah","gloss":"Isaiah"},{"id":"H0469","lemma":"אֱלִיצָפָן","transliteration":"elitsaphan","gloss":"Elizaphan"},{"id":"H2148","lemma":"זְכַרְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zekharyah","gloss":"Zechariah"},{"id":"H3100","lemma":"יוֹאֵל","transliteration":"yoel","gloss":"Joel"},{"id":"H3141","lemma":"יוֹרָם","transliteration":"yoram","gloss":"Joram"},{"id":"H3156","lemma"